OL,3,GNEWSAZZ Top drummer Frank Beard dies
OL,4,Aaged 77
OL,5,
OL,6,FLongtime ZZ Top drummer Frank Beard has
OL,7,Fdied aged 77, the band said.
OL,9,FA statement on the blues-rock band's
OL,10,Fwebsite said he died on Monday in
OL,11,Fhospice care at his ranch in Richmond,
OL,12,FTexas, with family members at his side.
OL,13,FHis cause of death was not specified.
OL,15,FBeard's passing "necessitates the
OL,16,Fcancellation" of the band's tour dates
OL,17,Fthis week in Utah and Colorado, the
OL,18,Fstatement said.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
