OL,3,GNEWSAZZ Top drummer Frank Beard dies
OL,4,Aaged 77
OL,5,
OL,6,FZZ Top was founded in 1969 and played
OL,7,Ftheir first live concert the following
OL,8,Fyear. Together they released 15 studio
OL,9,Fand four live albums, with hit singles
OL,10,Flike Gimme All Your Lovin', Sleeping
OL,11,FBag, and Viva Las Vegas.
